This is not a help file. It is its name.

A real one was a compiled book: chapters with little book icons, green
underlined words that jumped somewhere else, green dotted words that opened
a small yellow box with a definition in it, and three buttons across the top
- Contents, Index, Back.

It was written in a word processor, compiled by a tool nobody enjoyed using,
and read by people who had already tried everything else.

Nothing on this system opens it, because nothing on this system compiles
one. The help here is HELP.TXT beside this file, the Welcome window's "Did
you know...", and the README in every repository.
